flowchart TD
    A["任务到来（Task arrives）"] --> B{"问题已吃透？（Well understood?）"}
    B -- "吃透了" --> C["直接写规格（Write the spec directly）"]
    B -- "陌生或含混" --> D["先造丢弃版（Build a throwaway）"]
    D --> E["真问题浮出（Real questions surface）"]
    E --> F["代码可弃，认知留下（Discard code, keep the learning）"]
    F --> G["更准的规格（Sharper spec）"]
    G --> H["正式实现（The real build）"]
    D -. "造多个变体原型，而非一个（Several variants）" .-> I["利益相关者比较与反应（Stakeholders react）"]
    I -. "反应转成用户故事与验收标准" .-> G
    classDef core fill:#1a5fd0,stroke:#12449e,color:#ffffff;
    classDef gate fill:#fdf0ef,stroke:#e0b4b4,color:#8a3a34;
    classDef out fill:#edf1f7,stroke:#c9d6e6,color:#182430;
    class D,E,F core;
    class B gate;
    class A,C,G,H,I out;
